    {"先在电脑上安全弹出 TF 卡，等待完成，再在设备上退出并确认重启。电脑还在写文件时，不要拔线或重启设备。", "Safely eject the microSD card on your computer and wait for it to finish. Then exit on the device and confirm the restart. Do not unplug or restart while the computer is still writing files."},
    {"先打开 Wi-Fi ›", "Enable Wi-Fi first ›"},
    {"先检查远端，再点「上传本机位置…」，在确认页核对两端位置后上传或替换。取消已发出的上传后，服务器仍可能收到更新，下一次应重新检查远端。", "Check the server first, then choose Upload device position…. On the confirmation page, compare both positions before uploading or replacing. An upload already sent may reach the server even if canceled. Check the server again next time."},
    {"先结束同步、传书或书籍加载，请确认设备正在充电，或电量不低于 20%。下载和重启安装期间请保持供电，不要强制断电或重启。发现新版本后查看更新说明，点「下载并安装」；校验通过后，再点「重启并安装」。下载期间可在屏幕上取消。", "Finish sync, transfers, and book loading first. Connect power or ensure at least 20% battery. Keep the device powered during download and installation; do not force power off or restart. Read the release notes, choose Download and install, then Restart and install after verification. You can cancel the download on screen."},
