    {"可经设备热点传书，无需路由器。同一页面也可上传 TTF、OTF 字体和 PNG、JPEG 锁屏图片。保存 Wi-Fi 后也可经同一网络传书；手机需连着该网络。打开屏幕上的完整地址，逐本查看结果，完成后点「结束传书」。", "Use the device hotspot without a router to upload books, TTF/OTF fonts, or PNG/JPEG sleep images. A saved Wi-Fi network also works if your phone joins it. Open the full address shown, check each book's result, then choose End transfer."},
