    {"图片读取失败或已改变", "Image reading failed or image changed"},
    {"在「设置 → 固件更新」点「检查更新」。请先保存可用的 Wi-Fi，并打开 Wi-Fi 开关。检查失败时，按屏幕提示处理 Wi-Fi、互联网或更新服务器问题，再重试。", "Choose Check for updates in Settings → Firmware update. First save a working Wi-Fi network and enable Wi-Fi. If checking fails, follow the steps shown for Wi-Fi, internet, or update-server problems, then retry."},
    {"在「设置 → 网络与传输 → Wi-Fi 设置」点「添加网络」，从附近的网络中选择，用屏幕键盘输入密码。连接成功后才保存。只支持 2.4 GHz 网络，最多保存 5 个。键盘页 K1、K3 不起作用，K2 仍然全刷。", "In Settings → Wi-Fi & transfer → Wi-Fi settings, choose Add network. Select a nearby network and enter its password. It is saved only after connection succeeds. Supports 2.4 GHz only, up to 5 networks. K1/K3 do nothing on the keyboard; K2 refreshes."},
    {"在「设置 → 阅读」选择清晰、均衡或快速模式。清晰模式每页全刷；均衡和快速可设为 0–30 页，0 表示不自动全刷。", "Choose Clear, Balanced, or Fast in Settings > Reading. Clear fully refreshes every page. Balanced and Fast allow 0–30 pages between full refreshes; 0 disables automatic full refresh."},
    {"在书库点按一本书开始阅读，点按文件夹查看其中的书。再次打开同一本书会恢复已保存的位置；主页的「继续阅读」可打开上次阅读的书。", "Tap a book in the library to read it, or a folder to see its books. Reopening a book restores its saved position. Continue reading on the home screen opens your last book."},
    {"在书库长按一本书查看详情。长按正文图片进入放大查看，点右上角切换对比度，点左上角返回原页；这不会改变阅读位置。", "Hold a book in Library for details. Hold an image while reading to enlarge it. Tap the top right to change contrast or the top left to return. Your reading position stays unchanged."},
    {"在其他设备上接着读", "Continue on another device"},
    {"在正文工具中点「目录」，再切换到「书签」，点一条记录跳转。书签只保存在本机，不随 KOReader 位置同步；移动书籍时也要保留同名的 .picopage/ 目录。", "Open Contents from the reading tools, switch to Bookmarks, then tap an entry to jump there. Bookmarks stay on this device and do not sync with KOReader. When moving a book, keep its matching .picopage/ folder too."},
    {"在正文工具中选择「同步」，点「检查远端位置」。两端位置不同时，点「留在这里」或「跳到这里」；不会自动改动本机或远端。", "Open Sync from the reading tools and choose Check server position. If the positions differ, choose Stay here or Go here. Neither position changes automatically."},
    {"在电源与休眠中选好画面并保存。自定义图片可固定或轮播；准备休眠期间，仅再短按电源键取消；触摸和 K1、K2、K3 均忽略，K2 不全刷。长按电源键仍打开电源菜单。无可用图片时显示简洁屏保。", "Choose a sleep screen in Power & sleep and save. Custom images can stay fixed or rotate. While preparing to sleep, only a short power press cancels. Touch and K1/K2/K3 are ignored; K2 does not refresh. Hold power for the power menu. A simple screen appears if no image is usable."},
    {"在电脑上创建这个文件夹，或修改 PicoPage/settings.toml 中的 library.roots", "Create this folder on a computer, or change library.roots in PicoPage/settings.toml"},
