    {"将 EPUB 或 TXT 放入 TF 卡的 Books/。文章可放在 Books/Articles/；这是默认书库目录。TXT 支持 UTF-8、GB18030 和带 BOM 的 UTF-16，并从常见章节标题生成目录。", "Put EPUB or TXT files in Books/ on the microSD card. Articles can go in Books/Articles/. These are the default library folders. TXT supports UTF-8, GB18030, and UTF-16 with a BOM. Common chapter headings form its contents list."},
    {"将 TTF 或 OTF 字体放入 TF 卡根目录 Fonts/，重新启动设备后在排版页选择；经 Wi-Fi 传书上传的字体不需要重启。部分字符无法显示时，可换用包含这些字符的字体。", "Put TTF or OTF fonts in Fonts/ at the microSD card root. Restart, then select the font in Layout. Fonts uploaded over Wi-Fi do not need a restart. If some characters are missing, choose a font that includes them."},
    {"将删除 TF 卡中的原书文件。阅读记录和排版设置会保留；把同一本书放回原文件夹并使用原文件名，即可恢复。服务器上的记录不受影响。", "Deletes the original book file from the microSD card. Reading history and layout settings stay. Put the same book back in the same folder with the same filename to restore them. Server records are unaffected."},
